Fan Hub Plus — ReadMe (Section A foundation)

STACK
Native PHP 8.x (no Laravel/framework), MySQL/MariaDB via PDO prepared statements, Bootstrap 5.3 grid/offcanvas, custom Drameeo CSS, vanilla JavaScript.

Native PHP was chosen so routing, sessions, and queries stay visible line-by-line for evaluation (SRS 1.8 lists Laravel as an accepted option; this is a deliberate deviation).

INSTALL (XAMPP)
1. Copy this folder to C:\xampp\htdocs\funhub
2. Start Apache + MySQL
3. Import sql/schema.sql (phpMyAdmin or mysql CLI)
4. Open http://localhost/funhub/

CREDENTIALS
Admin: admin@fanhub.com / admin123
User:  user@fanhub.com / user123

PASSWORD RESET
Localhost debug-banner mode (no SMTP). forgot-password.php prints the reset URL on the same page.

AI TOOLS
Cursor / Grok used to scaffold files from the master plan. Review and understand every file before defense.
